# .gitignore — Claude Code plugin marketplace (skills, agents, hooks)
#
# What this repo ships IS text: SKILL.md files, .claude-plugin manifests,
# hook scripts, and font/asset files under anthropic-skills/. Those are
# deliverables and stay tracked. Everything below is either a secret, a
# per-machine artifact, or generated noise.

# ─── Secrets & credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hook scripts and skill helpers may read tokens from a local env file.
# Never let one reach a commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*_secret*
*.secret

# ─── Claude Code per-machine state ────────────────────────────────────
# Local permission overrides, transcripts, and session scratch. The
# tracked plugin definitions live in */.claude-plugin/ and */skills/,
# which these rules deliberately do not touch.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/ide/
.claude/history.jsonl

# ─── Python (skill helper scripts) ────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ─── Node (validators / tooling) ──────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# ─── Editor & IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Flip .vscode/ to a negation if you ever want to share workspace settings.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
[Tt]humbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ─── Scratch, backups, merge leftovers ────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
tmp/
temp/
scratch/

# ─── Vendored upstream ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# anthropic-skills/ is a copy of github.com/anthropics/skills. Its 410 files
# are currently STAGED in the index (not yet committed). To stop vendoring it,
# uncomment the line below AND run: git rm -r --cached anthropic-skills
# A .gitignore rule alone never affects paths already in the index.
# anthropic-skills/
